# ---- Booklit durable storage -------------------------------------------------
# Accounts, tethers (follows), sparks (likes), duels, challenges and cloud
# reading snapshots are stored in one server document. For production, point
# Booklit at a database so app updates / restarts never erase accounts.

# Option A (recommended): Supabase Postgres REST.
# Run the SQL in README.md -> "Durable accounts", then paste:
SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT.supabase.co
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key
BOOKLIT_SUPABASE_TABLE=booklit_store

# Option B: persistent disk mount (Render disk, Fly volume, VPS path).
# BOOKLIT_DATA_DIR=/var/data/booklit

# Session signing secret (keep it stable across deploys).
# BOOKLIT_AUTH_SECRET=change-me-to-a-long-random-string

# ---- Google Sign-In -----------------------------------------------------------
# Google Cloud Console -> APIs & Services -> Credentials -> OAuth client ID (Web).
# Authorized redirect URI: <your-site>/api/auth/google/callback
# (e.g. https://booklit.onrender.com/api/auth/google/callback or http://localhost:3000/api/auth/google/callback)
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
# Only needed when the public origin behind a proxy differs from the request host.
# GOOGLE_REDIRECT_URI=https://booklit.onrender.com/api/auth/google/callback

# ---- Password reset email -----------------------------------------------------
# Create a free key at https://resend.com/api-keys. The "from" must be a domain
# you verified there (onboarding@resend.dev works for quick tests).
RESEND_API_KEY=
# BOOKLIT_MAIL_FROM=Booklit <no-reply@yourdomain.com>
